{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":84,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"For the Chief Musician. On an instrument of Gath. A Psalm by the sons of Korah."},{"n":1,"text":"How lovely are your dwellings, LORD of Armies!","tok":[{"t":"How lovely "},{"t":"are","s":["H1121"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" dwellings, "},{"t":"LORD","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"of","s":["H1121"]},{"t":" Armies!"}]},{"n":2,"text":"My soul longs, and even faints for the courts of the LORD. My heart and my flesh cry out for the living God.","tok":[{"t":"My","s":["H3068"],"a":[5]},{"t":" soul longs, "},{"t":"and","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"even","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" faints "},{"t":"for","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" courts "},{"t":"of","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"LORD","s":["H3068"]},{"t":". "},{"t":"My","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" heart "},{"t":"and","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"my","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" flesh cry "},{"t":"out","s":["H4100"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"for","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" living "},{"t":"God","s":["H3068"]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"Yes, the sparrow has found a home, and the swallow a nest for herself, where she may have her young, near your altars, LORD of Armies, my King, and my God.","tok":[{"t":"Yes","s":["H1571"],"a":[0]},{"t":", "},{"t":"the","s":["H3068"],"a":[12]},{"t":" sparrow "},{"t":"has","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"found","s":["H1571"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"home","s":["H3068"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"and","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" swallow "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" nest "},{"t":"for","s":["H7442"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"herself","s":["H5315"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"where","s":["H2691"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"she","s":["H3820"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"may","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"have","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"her","s":["H1571"]},{"t":" young, near "},{"t":"your","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" altars, "},{"t":"LORD","s